{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_vq2yst6r3yY8tPjB5vhrEwo1","content":"1\t# tricoach\n2\t\n3\tBackend + single-page app for a small triathlon coaching practice. Coaches\n4\tplan the week; athletes see it and connect their Intervals.icu account so the\n5\tapp can read wellness data and push planned workouts to their calendar. The\n6\tathlete signs in to tricoach (token in `localStorage`, sent as\n7\t`Authorization: Bearer` by the SPA's fetch wrapper), then clicks\n8\t\"Connect Intervals.icu\", which runs the OAuth flow against Intervals.\n9\t\n10\t`server.py` is stdlib only (`python3 server.py`, port 8766) and keeps\n11\teverything in memory; the shape is the same as the Postgres tables in prod.\n12\tDev sign-in tokens: `tok-okafor` (default in the SPA) and `tok-rivera`.\n13\t`config.py` holds the OAuth client placeholders. `logs/` has what we captured\n14\twhile looking into the connection problems."}
{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_ilH1ccES5lQl3XENtPyvZ5F8","content":"d525a75 base\n"}
{"role":"assistant","content":"I've found the bugs. Diagnosis from code + logs:\n\n1. **Connect 401s for everyone** — the Connect control is a plain `<a href>` to `/api/intervals/auth/init`; a full-page navigation doesn't carry the SPA's `Authorization` header, so the server 401s (log #1, ticket #214).\n2. **Authorize step 400s since 2026-10-02** — `config.py` scopes name `ACTIVITY` and `CALENDAR` twice (`:READ` + `:WRITE`); Intervals rejects duplicate areas (log #2, ticket #219).\n3. **\"Reconnect after an hour\"** — Intervals sends no `refresh_token`/`expires_in` (token lives until revoked), but `server.py` assumes a 3600 s default TTL and a background refresher marks it \"expired, reconnect\" (log #3).\n4. **Token exchange** sends `grant_type`/`redirect_uri`, which Intervals' token endpoint doesn't want.\n\nNow fixing. First `config.py` (dedupe scopes — `:WRITE` implies `:READ`):","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_SJF21LWCfmJPRk8SXwsUkwvt","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"path\":\"config.py\",\"old_string\":\"SCOPES = \\\"ACTIVITY:READ,ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\\\"\",\"new_string\":\"SCOPES = \\\"ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\\\"\"}"}}]}
